    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/b8bb20f1bdd9a0b486ea8f6e6ee43fbc.avif?t=1712670336\" width=550 height=232 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><br>Cube Lands is a puzzle/adventure game based on blocks. Instead of &quot;levels&quot;, the puzzles are connected in a giant map made of unique areas. As the hero, you will be on a quest to reach the top of the world and defeat the great evils that await!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/caf5877935fd91e69e206173bba1a6f6.poster.avif?t=1712670336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/caf5877935fd91e69e206173bba1a6f6.webm?t=1712670336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/caf5877935fd91e69e206173bba1a6f6.mp4?t=1712670336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>Place Elemental Blocks, a new and unique concept for puzzle games, to gain height and activate their effects. You cannot jump, so use them wisely! There is 50+ different and innovative blocks with unique effects for you to discover in the 100+ handmade puzzles this game contains!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/07698c3d3bd826183d3dbce320dc1ca7.avif?t=1712670336\" data-has-big width=800 height=66 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>There is more to this game than just puzzles! During your adventure, you will find &quot;memories&quot; of an old tale. Discover the truth behind the origin of the Eye and the identity of the Hero and the Princess who traveled together a long time ago!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/b8bb20f1bdd9a0b486ea8f6e6ee43fbc.avif?t=1712670336\" width=550 height=232 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><br>Cube Lands is a puzzle/adventure game based on blocks. Instead of &quot;levels&quot;, the puzzles are connected in a giant map made of unique areas. As the hero, you will be on a quest to reach the top of the world and defeat the great evils that await!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/caf5877935fd91e69e206173bba1a6f6.poster.avif?t=1712670336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/caf5877935fd91e69e206173bba1a6f6.webm?t=1712670336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/caf5877935fd91e69e206173bba1a6f6.mp4?t=1712670336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><br>Place Elemental Blocks, a new and unique concept for puzzle games, to gain height and activate their effects. You cannot jump, so use them wisely! There is 50+ different and innovative blocks with unique effects for you to discover in the 100+ handmade puzzles this game contains!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902460/extras/07698c3d3bd826183d3dbce320dc1ca7.avif?t=1712670336\" data-has-big width=800 height=66 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><br>There is more to this game than just puzzles! During your adventure, you will find &quot;memories&quot; of an old tale. Discover the truth behind the origin of the Eye and the identity of the Hero and the Princess who traveled together a long time ago!",
